.
.  Create a GIF file for a sd plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 50
SET READ FORMAT 3F4.0,F5.0,F6.0,F3.0,2F9.0
READ PBF11.DAT YEAR DAY BOT SD F11 FLAG WV CO2
.
RETAIN YEAR DAY BOT SD F11 WV CO2 FLAG SUBSET FLAG 0
LET MONTH = INT(DAY/30.5)+1
.
TITLE SIZE 3
TITLE AUTOMATIC
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Month
X2LABEL Point Barrow (Alaska) Ozone Study
Y1LABEL Standard Deviation of Water Vapor
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 10
LINES BLANK SOLID
CHARACTER X BLANK
XLIMITS 0 15
YLIMITS 0 .004
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
SD PLOT WV MONTH
.
QUIT
